{"title":"drawing ravens as threshold guides","link":"https://keningzhu.com/journal/drawing-ravens-as-threshold-guides","date":1751890569000,"content":"<figure>\n          \n        \n        \n\n        \n          \n            \n          \n            \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                <img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/c6e6ed36-3662-4b3b-a23d-2c4eb893e0ad/raven1.jpeg?format=1000w\" width=\"4032\" height=\"3024\" srcset=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/c6e6ed36-3662-4b3b-a23d-2c4eb893e0ad/raven1.jpeg?format=100w 100w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/c6e6ed36-3662-4b3b-a23d-2c4eb893e0ad/raven1.jpeg?format=300w 300w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/c6e6ed36-3662-4b3b-a23d-2c4eb893e0ad/raven1.jpeg?format=500w 500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/c6e6ed36-3662-4b3b-a23d-2c4eb893e0ad/raven1.jpeg?format=750w 750w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/c6e6ed36-3662-4b3b-a23d-2c4eb893e0ad/raven1.jpeg?format=1000w 1000w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/c6e6ed36-3662-4b3b-a23d-2c4eb893e0ad/raven1.jpeg?format=1500w 1500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/c6e6ed36-3662-4b3b-a23d-2c4eb893e0ad/raven1.jpeg?format=2500w 2500w\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n\n            \n          \n        \n          \n        \n\n        \n      \n        </figure>\n      \n\n    \n  \n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n  <p><em>channeling quiet intuition through ravens<br /></em><a href=\"https://keningzhu.com/visual-art\" target=\"_blank\"><em>visual art</em></a><em> | </em><a href=\"https://keningzhu.com/journal/tag/sketchbook\" target=\"_blank\"><em>sketchbook</em></a><em> | </em><a href=\"https://keningzhu.com/birds\"><em>birds</em></a></p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n<hr /> \n\n\n  <p>since returning to my life in Istanbul, I’ve been feeling a messy, chaotic energy that I didn’t quite know what to do with. as if, during this <a href=\"https://buttondown.com/keningzhu/archive/the-feeling-of-acceleration/\" target=\"_blank\">period of expansion and acceleration</a>, all the voices in me were busy arguing with themselves (very <em>five of wands</em> energy) — complaining, worrying, doubting, pressurizing, pointing out deadlines and to-do lists, being tired and over-stimulated, pulling me five or ten different directions, and pointing out the cavernous gap between where I am now, and where my future dreams want to take me. </p><p>maybe it’s that, after years of being adrift at sea, the “stability” and sense of belonging I feel now in my self-constructed life feels so hard won — paid for with blood — that some part of me is absolutely terrified to leave the little island of my contentment to venture somewhere new… whether this means <em>moving</em> or <em>getting married</em> or <em>having a child </em>or<em> writing a book. </em></p><p>when I feel like my mind is a jumbled mess, I like to draw. in the last years, I’ve been feeling the call to return to physical mediums, to live more of a <a href=\"https://keningzhu.com/journal/tag/sketchbook\" target=\"_blank\">life on my sketchbook</a> — drawing as a way of metabolizing my psyche on the page, without the limited construct of language. and so, I decided to follow a whispering urge to draw birds. </p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n\n    \n  \n    \n\n      \n\n      \n        <figure>\n          \n        \n        \n\n        \n          \n            \n          \n            \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                <img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/d0cd9945-3f99-4422-9306-f4d4c4d20750/raven3.jpeg?format=1000w\" width=\"4032\" height=\"3024\" srcset=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/d0cd9945-3f99-4422-9306-f4d4c4d20750/raven3.jpeg?format=100w 100w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/d0cd9945-3f99-4422-9306-f4d4c4d20750/raven3.jpeg?format=300w 300w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/d0cd9945-3f99-4422-9306-f4d4c4d20750/raven3.jpeg?format=500w 500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/d0cd9945-3f99-4422-9306-f4d4c4d20750/raven3.jpeg?format=750w 750w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/d0cd9945-3f99-4422-9306-f4d4c4d20750/raven3.jpeg?format=1000w 1000w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/d0cd9945-3f99-4422-9306-f4d4c4d20750/raven3.jpeg?format=1500w 1500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/d0cd9945-3f99-4422-9306-f4d4c4d20750/raven3.jpeg?format=2500w 2500w\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n\n            \n          \n        \n          \n        \n\n        \n      \n        </figure>\n      \n\n    \n  \n\n\n  \n\n\n<hr /> \n\n\n  <p>I gathered reference images for beautiful, colorful birds. then something strange happened to me. I went through an unexpectedly intense experience that felt like it was an initiation or a test, designed to target my weaknesses, to activate old patterns, and force me to make a conscious choice about the big commitments of my life — my partner, my evolution, my future. </p><p>after that ordeal, I decided that I needed to channel the energy of a <em>specific</em> kind of bird — a dark primal intelligence, a being that was unafraid of shadows and depths, of transformation, and of living in threshold spaces. </p><p>so, I choose the raven. </p><p>I started with some loose sketches of the ravens using reference images — but focused mainly on capturing the essence/spirit of the animal — instead of attempting a mechanically faithful reproduction. then I got distracted for a week. I just sat down this morning to start and finish a single raven drawing. I actually drew it to about 50% (see below left) and felt an urge to stop — to do more “responsible” activities, like client work or preparing for my <a href=\"https://keningzhu.com/sharing-space-camp\">new course</a>. </p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n\n    \n  \n    \n\n      \n\n      \n        <figure>\n          \n        \n        \n\n        \n          \n            \n          \n            \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                <img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/3e7aea53-af42-49e6-83ef-a4af27572ab5/raven4.jpeg?format=1000w\" width=\"4032\" height=\"3024\" srcset=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/3e7aea53-af42-49e6-83ef-a4af27572ab5/raven4.jpeg?format=100w 100w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/3e7aea53-af42-49e6-83ef-a4af27572ab5/raven4.jpeg?format=300w 300w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/3e7aea53-af42-49e6-83ef-a4af27572ab5/raven4.jpeg?format=500w 500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/3e7aea53-af42-49e6-83ef-a4af27572ab5/raven4.jpeg?format=750w 750w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/3e7aea53-af42-49e6-83ef-a4af27572ab5/raven4.jpeg?format=1000w 1000w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/3e7aea53-af42-49e6-83ef-a4af27572ab5/raven4.jpeg?format=1500w 1500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/3e7aea53-af42-49e6-83ef-a4af27572ab5/raven4.jpeg?format=2500w 2500w\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n\n            \n          \n        \n          \n        \n\n        \n      \n        </figure>\n      \n\n    \n  \n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n\n    \n  \n    \n\n      \n\n      \n        <figure>\n          \n        \n        \n\n        \n          \n            \n          \n            \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                <img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/0eb02d60-894b-4997-b0f4-a522d8779f48/raven5.jpeg?format=1000w\" width=\"4032\" height=\"3024\" srcset=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/0eb02d60-894b-4997-b0f4-a522d8779f48/raven5.jpeg?format=100w 100w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/0eb02d60-894b-4997-b0f4-a522d8779f48/raven5.jpeg?format=300w 300w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/0eb02d60-894b-4997-b0f4-a522d8779f48/raven5.jpeg?format=500w 500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/0eb02d60-894b-4997-b0f4-a522d8779f48/raven5.jpeg?format=750w 750w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/0eb02d60-894b-4997-b0f4-a522d8779f48/raven5.jpeg?format=1000w 1000w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/0eb02d60-894b-4997-b0f4-a522d8779f48/raven5.jpeg?format=1500w 1500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/0eb02d60-894b-4997-b0f4-a522d8779f48/raven5.jpeg?format=2500w 2500w\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n\n            \n          \n        \n          \n        \n\n        \n      \n        </figure>\n      \n\n    \n  \n\n\n  \n\n\n<hr /> \n\n\n  <p>then I decided to finish, because there is such pleasure for me in following an impulse to its end. I realized, afterwards, that what this raven drawing is teaching me isn’t “how to draw ravens,” but <em>“how to follow a small whisper so completely, with full commitment, from the first intuitive tug, to the end release into the digital cosmos”</em> — such that the practice of materializing this raven is a metaphor for sensing, and creating anything worthwhile. </p><p>it’s the practice of not listening to the chattering voices in my mind, but tuning into a deeper, darker, more embodied knowing. </p><p>I’m trusting that this wisdom will carry me into the beyond. </p>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n\n    \n  \n    \n\n      \n\n      \n        <figure>\n          \n        \n        \n\n        \n          \n            \n          \n            \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                \n                <img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/e50d12db-fe3f-415f-884c-7ddae229b4bd/raven2.jpeg?format=1000w\" width=\"4032\" height=\"3024\" srcset=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/e50d12db-fe3f-415f-884c-7ddae229b4bd/raven2.jpeg?format=100w 100w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/e50d12db-fe3f-415f-884c-7ddae229b4bd/raven2.jpeg?format=300w 300w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/e50d12db-fe3f-415f-884c-7ddae229b4bd/raven2.jpeg?format=500w 500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/e50d12db-fe3f-415f-884c-7ddae229b4bd/raven2.jpeg?format=750w 750w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/e50d12db-fe3f-415f-884c-7ddae229b4bd/raven2.jpeg?format=1000w 1000w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/e50d12db-fe3f-415f-884c-7ddae229b4bd/raven2.jpeg?format=1500w 1500w, https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/51e8148de4b01c1eb79c1977/e50d12db-fe3f-415f-884c-7ddae229b4bd/raven2.jpeg?format=2500w 2500w\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n\n            \n          \n        \n          \n        \n\n        \n      \n        </figure>\n      \n\n    \n  \n\n\n  \n\n\n\n\n\n  <p><strong>explore more</strong>:<br /><br /><a href=\"https://keningzhu.com/journal/dark-bird-presence\" target=\"_blank\">dark bird presence</a><br /><a href=\"https://keningzhu.com/journal/tree-butterfly-lightening-tree\" target=\"_blank\">tree, butterfly, lightening, tree</a><br />more <a href=\"https://keningzhu.com/visual-art\" target=\"_blank\">visual art</a></p>","author":"Kening Zhu","siteTitle":"kening zhu","siteHash":"ef8a94b9fc20c32a4ee7d94ee971337d278e8b2fafe747123e4eb5cea026e84e","entryHash":"86ce7a2c1b349673e8752424bddca7b966f4e168c4e4b7f217dcc3a49646adf0","category":"Sites"}